{"id":"77959a5a83dc456a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness.md","title":"单位产生式消除的正确性","display":"thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness — 单位产生式消除的正确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness"],"display":"thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness — 单位产生式消除的正确性","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-unit-elimination]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.4, pp. 91–92; scans 99–100","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness — 单位产生式消除的正确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e138531b17f3eae8\" href=\"?note=e138531b17f3eae8\" title=\"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination\">73-df-cfg-unit-elimination</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.4, pp. 91–92; scans 99–100"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)=(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)\">\\(\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)=(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e138531b17f3eae8\" href=\"?note=e138531b17f3eae8\" title=\"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination\">73-df-cfg-unit-elimination</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G))=L(G)\\land\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P^{\\mathsf u}\\;\\alpha\\notin V^1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G))=L(G)\\land\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P^{\\mathsf u}\\;\\alpha\\notin V^1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个新规则展开为有限单位链加一个旧非单位规则；反向在成功推导树中压缩所有连续单位边。循环的单位规则若没有非单位出口不能独自生成终结词，所以不会造成遗漏。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e138531b17f3eae8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-unit-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e138531b17f3eae8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)=(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)$，见 [[73-df-cfg-unit-elimination]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)=(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G))=L(G)\\land\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P^{\\mathsf u}\\;\\alpha\\notin V^1","display":true}],"bytes":1570,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-unit-elimination-correctness|单位产生式消除的正确性]]"}],"outgoing":["e138531b17f3eae8"]}